---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Instructional resources"
  description="Supplemental Everglades Literacy lessons for classroom, virtual, and family learning."
>
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6 py-12">
    <p class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-water">Classroom extras</p>
    <h1 class="mt-3 font-display text-4xl font-bold text-marsh">Additional instructional resources</h1>
    <p class="mt-6 text-lg text-ink/80">
      Bite-sized, standards-friendly activities that teachers can use on any digital platform or in
      a family science night.
    </p>
    <ul class="mt-8 space-y-4">
      <li class="rounded-xl bg-white p-5 ring-1 ring-marsh/10">Field journal prompts for a backyard or campus walk</li>
      <li class="rounded-xl bg-white p-5 ring-1 ring-marsh/10">Water cycle mini-lesson with Everglades sheet-flow vocabulary</li>
      <li class="rounded-xl bg-white p-5 ring-1 ring-marsh/10">Wading-bird identification cards for science nights</li>
    </ul>
  </section>
</Layout>
